	(text "Do not solder the pots onto PCB,\nuse wires. Use GAIN/SUSTAIN pot\npin 3 PCB hole to add a jumper\nwire to pin 2 hole of the TONE\npot. Thus sending the signal\nfrom T1 straight to T4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.586 170.18 0)
